<listitem><para>FLASH_IT_SNECCERR_BANK1 : Single ECC Error Correction on Bank 1 Interrupt source </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>FLASH_IT_DBECCERR_BANK1 : Double Detection ECC Error on Bank 1 Interrupt source </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>FLASH_IT_CRCEND_BANK1 : CRC End on Bank 1 Interrupt source </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>FLASH_IT_CRCRDERR_BANK1 : CRC Read error on Bank 1 Interrupt source </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>FLASH_IT_ALL_BANK1 : All Bank 1 Interrupt sources</para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
